       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CAJAL-NEURON-SUITE-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CAJAL-FORMAL-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PROOF-1-LINEAR-AFFINE-EMBED  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PROOF-2-KRONECKER-SUM-COMM   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PROOF-3-UNROLLED-TRUNCATION  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PROOF-4-GRADIENT-CONVERGENCE PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PROOF-5-H-BRIDGE-COMPATIBLE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PROOF-6-RULE18-STABILITY-MET PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-VERIFICATION-RESULTS.
           05  WS-TPA-0100H-SOUNDNESS          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-SUITE-STATUS           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-LINEAR-EMBEDDINGS.
           PERFORM 2000-VERIFY-KRONECKER-COMMUTATION.
           PERFORM 3000-VERIFY-UNROLLED-TRUNCATION.
           PERFORM 4000-VERIFY-GRADIENT-BOUNDS.
           PERFORM 5000-VERIFY-HARDWARE-INTERFACES.
           PERFORM 6000-SYNTHESIZE-TOTAL-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-LINEAR-EMBEDDINGS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PROOF-1-LINEAR-AFFINE-EMBED.
       2000-VERIFY-KRONECKER-COMMUTATION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PROOF-2-KRONECKER-SUM-COMM.
       3000-VERIFY-UNROLLED-TRUNCATION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PROOF-3-UNROLLED-TRUNCATION.
       4000-VERIFY-GRADIENT-BOUNDS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PROOF-4-GRADIENT-CONVERGENCE.
       5000-VERIFY-HARDWARE-INTERFACES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PROOF-5-H-BRIDGE-COMPATIBLE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PROOF-6-RULE18-STABILITY-MET.
       6000-SYNTHESIZE-TOTAL-PROOF.
           IF WS-PROOF-1-LINEAR-AFFINE-EMBED = 1 AND
              WS-PROOF-2-KRONECKER-SUM-COMM = 1 AND
              WS-PROOF-3-UNROLLED-TRUNCATION = 1 AND
              WS-PROOF-4-GRADIENT-CONVERGENCE = 1 AND
              WS-PROOF-5-H-BRIDGE-COMPATIBLE = 1 AND
              WS-PROOF-6-RULE18-STABILITY-MET = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-SUITE-STATUS
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-SUITE-STATUS.
